_page":167,"chrome_related":168,"chrome_document":169,"chrome_what_covers":170,"chrome_action":171,"interior_documents":172,"interior_contact":173,"interior_contact_p":174,"interior_subscribe_h":175,"interior_subscribe_p":176,"interior_subscribe_cta":139,"about_dues_cta":177,"page_grievance_h":178,"nf_doc_title":179,"nf_title":180,"nf_lede":181,"nf_home":182,"nf_calendar":183},"Saltar al contenido principal","Progress now, not someday!","Join Now","Próximos eventos","Calendario completo","Aún no hay eventos programados","Las nuevas reuniones y acciones aparecen primero en el %s — suscríbete allí y no te pierdas ninguna.","calendario","Ver evento","Del blog","Todas las publicaciones","Leer la publicación","Publicaciones muy pronto","El capítulo está escribiendo sus primeras publicaciones — vuelve pronto.","Home","Featured","Search posts…","No posts yet","The chapter blog is warming up. Check back soon.","Never miss a post","One email when we publish. No spam, no lists sold — ever.","Subscribe","Share","Copy link","Email it","Read next","Get involved","Meetings, actions and committees are open to everyone. Come find your place in the work.","Event calendar","Month","List","Nothing scheduled this month","Check the next month or subscribe below and never miss one.","Subscribe to the calendar","Add every meeting and action to your own calendar automatically.","Google Calendar","iCal \u002F .ics","RSVP","Add to calendar","About this event","Details","Date","Time","Location","Save your spot","RSVP and we’ll send the details straight to you.","RSVP Now","Questions? Contact","More upcoming events","En esta página","Relacionado","Documento","Qué cubre","Acción","Documents","Contact","Questions, ideas, or press —","Never miss an update","One email when something new lands — meetings, actions, and posts. No spam, ever.","Update my dues","Need to report something?","Page not found","This page got organized out of existence","The page you’re looking for isn’t here — it may have moved, or the link may be broken.","Back home","See the calendar",[185,189,193,197,201,204],{"id":186,"label":187,"color":188},"chapter","Todo el capítulo","#B01B22",{"id":190,"label":191,"color":192},"poled","Educación política","#33518F",{"id":194,"label":195,"color":196},"mutual","Ayuda mutua","#1B6B40",{"id":198,"label":199,"color":200},"labor","Laboral","#8F5715",{"id":202,"label":38,"color":203},"electoral","#6E3B87",{"id":205,"label":206,"color":207},"social","Social","#0A6B74",{"lang":4,"id":209,"path":210,"kind":211,"template":212,"title":84,"lede":213,"content":22,"documents":214,"grievance":215,"newhere":216,"about":110,"gi":221,"calendar":110,"languages":295,"seo":299},359,"\u002Fes\u002Fparticipa\u002F","get_involved","page-templates\u002Fget-involved.php","No se necesita experiencia ni una política perfecta. Si quieres un Valle mejor, aquí hay un lugar para ti.",[],{"show":17,"body":22},{"heading":217,"body":218,"link_label":219,"url":220,"external":12},"New here?","Come to an \u003Cspan class=\"notranslate\">PROGRESS 101\u003C\u002Fspan> — our intro session for new and curious folks.","Find a session","\u002Fcalendar\u002F",{"join":222,"committees":238,"channels":240,"faq":255,"card":273,"related":278,"nav":287},{"visible":17,"heading":223,"steps":224},"Cómo unirte",[225,229,233],{"title":226,"body":227,"link_label":228,"href":21,"external":17},"Become a member","Sign up in a few minutes. Dues are sliding-scale — pay what you can, and \u003Cstrong>no one is turned away for lack of funds\u003C\u002Fstrong>.","Join now →",{"title":230,"body":231,"link_label":232,"href":220,"external":12},"Come to Progress Now 101","Our intro session for new and curious folks — what we stand for, what our chapter is working on, and how to plug in. Offered virtually and in person, multiple times a month. You don't have to be a member yet to attend.","Find a session →",{"title":234,"body":235,"link_label":236,"href":237,"external":12},"Get onboarded & plug in","After 101, we'll add you to our WhatsApp and match you with a committee that fits your interests and capacity — whether that's an hour a month or a night a week.","Browse committees ↓","#committees",{"visible":17,"heading":97,"intro":239},"Los comités son donde ocurre el trabajo. Cada uno se reúne con regularidad y da la bienvenida a nuevos miembros — comunícate por el WhatsApp o en cualquier reunión general.",{"visible":17,"heading":241,"items":242},"Canales de comunicación",[243,247,250],{"label":244,"desc":245,"link_label":22,"url":22,"badge":246,"external":12},"WhatsApp","Our main channel — members receive an invite during onboarding","Members only",{"label":47,"desc":248,"link_label":249,"url":21,"badge":22,"external":17},"Events, actions, and updates for everyone","Follow",{"label":251,"desc":252,"link_label":253,"url":254,"badge":22,"external":12},"Email","Questions, press, and anything else","Write us","mailto:hello@example.org",{"visible":17,"heading":256,"items":257},"Preguntas comunes",[258,261,264,267,270],{"question":259,"answer":260},"Do I have to be a member to come to events?","Nope — most of our events are open to everyone. Come to a 101 or a social, meet folks, and see if it's for you. No pressure.",{"question":262,"answer":263},"How much are dues?","Dues are sliding-scale — most folks pay a few dollars a month. If dues are a barrier, talk to us: no one is turned away for lack of funds.",{"question":265,"answer":266},"I've never done anything political before. Is that okay?","More than okay — it's the norm. Most members joined without any organizing experience. Progress Now 101 exists exactly for this, and committees will teach you everything as you go.",{"question":268,"answer":269},"Can I participate without being publicly visible?","Yes. There are plenty of ways to contribute behind the scenes, and we take members' privacy and safety seriously. Talk to us about what you're comfortable with.",{"question":271,"answer":272},"How much time does membership take?","As much or as little as you have. Some members show up to one event a month; others help lead committees. Capacity changes — that's fine. The work is a marathon, not a sprint.",{"heading":274,"body":275,"link_label":276,"url":277,"external":17},"¿Con ganas de empezar ya?","Hacerte miembro toma cinco minutos, y las cuotas son de paga-lo-que-puedas.","Únete al DSA","https:\u002F\u002Fact.dsausa.org\u002Fdonate\u002Fmembership",[279,281,284],{"label":280,"url":220,"external":12},"Event Calendar",{"label":282,"url":283,"external":12},"Bylaws & Code of Conduct","\u002Fbylaws-code-of-conduct\u002F",{"label":285,"url":286,"external":12},"Mission & History","\u002Fabout\u002F#mission",[288,290,291,293],{"href":289,"label":223},"#join",{"href":237,"label":97},{"href":292,"label":241},"#channels",{"href":294,"label":256},"#faq",[296,298],{"code":9,"label":10,"name":11,"active":12,"url":297},"https:\u002F\u002Frgvdsa.test:8890\u002Fget-involved\u002F",{"code":4,"label":15,"name":16,"active":17,"url":85},{"title":300,"description":213,"canonical":85,"robots":301,"hreflang":302},"Participa – PROGRESS NOW","index,follow",[303,304],{"lang":9,"href":297},{"lang":4,"href":85},1788608640764]